    "Name": "Whiptail",
    "Details": "Conceived as a fast and manoeuvrable harasser, the Whiptail was produced by the Acme Widgets corporation for the Star League Defense Force; and later the armies of the Great Houses. A 10 ton hover tank, the Whiptail was known for its speed, and the rear mounted vehicular mine dispenser. A trio of turret mounted machine guns made up the vehicles only ranged weapons. Production ceased with the fall of the Star League and the last Whiptail was destroyed sometime after the Second Succession War.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 10/15 hexes / 300/450 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>        25      5\n<b>Left</b>          25      5\n<b>Right</b>        25      5\n<b>Rear</b>         20      5\n<b>Turret</b>       20      5\n\n<b>Total</b>      115     25</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Quick off the Line</color>",
